# List of IPs for centralize-logs.sh
# - First non-comment, non-empty line = BindAddress (source IP for SCP)
# - Remaining lines = UDM IPs to fetch vpn-monitor.log from
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Example: this host has 192.168.1.10; fetch logs from the other two UDMs.
# 192.168.1.10
# 192.168.1.20
# 192.168.1.30
